  entryTitle: Chime
  entryDescription: A little blue fairy-moth creature I met when I first woke up
    in the Astral Plane. She's obnoxious sometimes, but it feels like she's really
    trying to help me. Something about her is pulling at me, she seems vaguely familiar...
